msgctxt "#30161"
msgid "Continuous stream: the calibration software's patterns follow each other inside one stream that never stops, so the signal (SDR, HDR10, HLG or Dolby Vision) is never turned off and on between patterns, and a pattern is on screen about 0.5 s after it is asked for. A change of signal, resolution or metadata starts a new stream. One clip per pattern: the previous way, where every pattern restarts the video and the signal. Needs an Amlogic box; elsewhere clips are used. Manual test patterns are always clips."
msgstr ""

